# Consistent line endings: store and check out LF (Unix style) everywhere.
# The project is cross-platform (CI runs on Linux; installers target
# Windows/macOS/Linux). PowerShell 5.1/7 run LF-only .ps1 scripts fine,
# and the .lyx test fixtures must stay LF for the parser tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
